{
  "title": "ISic001366. Funerary inscription for Primigenios",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ἐνθάδ[ε]</span>  <span data-text=\"κῖ\n                    τε\">[κῖ-]<br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>τε</span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\"><span data-text=\"Πριμ\">Π&lt;ρ?&gt;ιμ</span>[ιγένιος?]</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ὑποδ[ιάκονος] <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"κὲ\">κὲ</span>  <span data-text=\"θυρ\">θυρ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔ[.</span><span data-text=\"κῖ\n                    τε\">..]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ΤΕ</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\"><span data-text=\"Πριμ\">ΠΙΜ</span>[.......]</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΥΠΟΔ[.......]<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"κὲ\">ΚΕ</span><span data-text=\"θυρ\">ΘΥΡ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text after IG</span></span>; </li><li><span class=\"lines 1-2\">lines.1-2: <span>[κεῖ]|τε CIG IV 9501; [κῖ]|τε IG XIV 547, Agnello 1953 n. 54</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 2\">line.2: <span>Πιμ[ιγένιος IG XIV 547, Agnello 1953 n. 54; ΠΙΜ[ CIG IV 9501</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 4\">line.4: <span>θυρ[ CIG IV 9501; θυρ[ωρός IG XIV 547, Agnello 1953 n. 54</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>Here lies Primigenios, hypodiakonos and ...</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The Christian funerary inscription records the name of the deceased, <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμιγένιος</span> (cf. <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμιγένης</span> in IG XIV 467 = <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001291\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001291</a> and <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμογένης</span> in IG XIV 546 = <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001365\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001365</a>, both from Catania), together with some ranks of the ecclesiastical hierarchy (cf. Grossi Gondi 1920, 120–125, 133–136); on the reading at l. 4 <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">θυρ[ωρός</span>, see Agnello (1953 n. 54).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Kirchhoff 1877 9501 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249</a></li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">547</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a></li><li> Agnello 1953 no.54 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211</a></li></ul>  <ul><li> Grossi Gondi 1920 120–125, 133–136 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002241\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002241</a>  </li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
  "divs": [
    {
      "id": "editions",
      "html": "<div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ἐνθάδ[ε]</span>  <span data-text=\"κῖ\n                    τε\">[κῖ-]<br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>τε</span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\"><span data-text=\"Πριμ\">Π&lt;ρ?&gt;ιμ</span>[ιγένιος?]</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ὑποδ[ιάκονος] <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"κὲ\">κὲ</span>  <span data-text=\"θυρ\">θυρ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔ[.</span><span data-text=\"κῖ\n                    τε\">..]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ΤΕ</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\"><span data-text=\"Πριμ\">ΠΙΜ</span>[.......]</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΥΠΟΔ[.......]<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"κὲ\">ΚΕ</span><span data-text=\"θυρ\">ΘΥΡ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "apparatus",
      "html": "<h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text after IG</span></span>; </li><li><span class=\"lines 1-2\">lines.1-2: <span>[κεῖ]|τε CIG IV 9501; [κῖ]|τε IG XIV 547, Agnello 1953 n. 54</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 2\">line.2: <span>Πιμ[ιγένιος IG XIV 547, Agnello 1953 n. 54; ΠΙΜ[ CIG IV 9501</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 4\">line.4: <span>θυρ[ CIG IV 9501; θυρ[ωρός IG XIV 547, Agnello 1953 n. 54</span></span></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation",
      "html": "<h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>Here lies Primigenios, hypodiakonos and ...</p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "commentary",
      "html": "<h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The Christian funerary inscription records the name of the deceased, <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμιγένιος</span> (cf. <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμιγένης</span> in IG XIV 467 = <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001291\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001291</a> and <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμογένης</span> in IG XIV 546 = <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001365\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001365</a>, both from Catania), together with some ranks of the ecclesiastical hierarchy (cf. Grossi Gondi 1920, 120–125, 133–136); on the reading at l. 4 <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">θυρ[ωρός</span>, see Agnello (1953 n. 54).</p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "bibliography",
      "html": "<h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Kirchhoff 1877 9501 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249</a></li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">547</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a></li><li> Agnello 1953 no.54 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211</a></li></ul>  <ul><li> Grossi Gondi 1920 120–125, 133–136 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002241\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002241</a>  </li></ul>  "
